  "description": "Replacement of the existing rear infill conservatory with a new extension on the same footprint,  the addition of a small side extension, as well as alterations to the existing outrigger. Internal  alterations to create an open plan kitchen/dining area and a new, larger wc to replace the existing. New flat roof  to the rear to be lead covered with lead rolls and have two rooflights. The new roof is to have a pitched section at the front of the side extension facing the street. Existing window at the rear of the first floor to be changed to new french doors leading to a new roof terrace on part of the flat roof. Existing main roof to be re-tiled, existing brickwork to be cleaned, repaired and re-pointed where necessary, existing windows to be overhauled, existing guttering, RWP's and SVPs to be replaced, a new bin store to the front garden, together with internal and external alterations and general refurbishment of the house.",
